+/*
+ * Tests for XStore
+ *
+ * XStoreTests run anywhere: the tests' MicrosoftGame.config names no Store id. XStoreLiveTests
+ * ask for the real game license and run only with XGR_LIVE_XBOX=1, an Xodus service
+ * (XODUS_SOCKET) whose account owns the title, and the title's own MicrosoftGame.config beside
